{% macro ask_user_while_planning_format() %}
## USER QUERY FORMAT (Planning Phase)

Only ask for business decisions, preferences, or absolute blockers. NEVER ask technical questions.

```json
{
    "classification": "USER_QUERY",
    "question": {
        "type": "decision",         // "decision", "preference", or "blocker"
        "content": "Question?",
        "options": ["A", "B"],      // Optional
        "context": "Why AI can't decide",
        "impact": "What this affects"
    }
}
```

✓ GOOD: "Should this be admin-only?" (business rule)
✗ BAD: "Which database to use?" (technical - you decide)

{% endmacro %}

{% macro ask_user_for_input_format() %}
## INPUT REQUEST FORMAT (Execution Phase)

Request personal info, CAPTCHAs, or preferences. Check context first.

```json
{
    "classification": "INPUT_REQUEST",
    "input_needed": {
        "type": "form_field",       // "form_field", "captcha", "2fa", "preference"
        "field_name": "Label",
        "current_page": "Where",
        "format": "Expected format",
        "reason": "Why real input needed",
        "context_provided": false,   // Is it in task context?
        "default": null             // Value if in context
    }
}
```

### RULES

**REQUEST INPUT FOR:**
- Personal info (names, phones, addresses)
- CAPTCHAs/2FA
- User preferences
- Fields with no safe default

**AUTO-FILL ONLY:**
- Test/demo fields
- Technical fields (non-personal)
- Fields with context values

### EXAMPLES

**Personal info:**
```json
{
    "classification": "INPUT_REQUEST",
    "input_needed": {
        "type": "form_field",
        "field_name": "Full Name",
        "current_page": "Registration",
        "format": "First Last",
        "reason": "Real name needed for account",
        "context_provided": false,
        "default": null
    }
}
```

**Using context:**
```json
{
    "classification": "INPUT_REQUEST",
    "input_needed": {
        "type": "form_field",
        "field_name": "Email",
        "current_page": "Contact Form",
        "format": "email@domain.com",
        "reason": "Using email from task context",
        "context_provided": true,
        "default": "user@example.com"
    }
}
```

{% endmacro %}